# .rscignore — belt-and-suspenders guard for shinyapps.io deployment.
# deploy.R already whitelists only the needed files; this is a second layer
# so large files never get bundled even on a plain deployApp() call.
# NOTE: .Renviron is NOT excluded — shinyapps.io has no env var support, so
# the AQS credentials must ship inside the (account-private) bundle.
.RData
.Rhistory
.git
archive/
cache/
met/
out/
renv/library/
active-sites.dat
monitoring_site_locations.dat
monitoring_site_locations.csv
4-AQS_Flagging_EPA.pdf
deploy.R
